/Assuming you have a list of numbers called 
/ListNumbers with a fixed length of 8, 
/write a MARIE program that reads and 
/displays all the numbers from the list
/Ex,
/ListNumbers = {1, 44, -3, 22, 0, 55, 5, -100}
Load StartAddr
Store pointer


check,  Load counter
        skipcond 400            / 如果等于0，就跳过下一行       
        Jump Loop
        Halt
Loop,   LoadI pointer
        Output
        Load pointer
        Add One
        Store pointer
        Load counter
        Subt One
        Store counter
        Jump check

StartAddr,      Adr listNumbers
One,            dec 1
pointer,        hex 0
counter,        dec 8
listNumbers,    dec 1
                dec 44
                dec -3
                dec 22
                dec 0
                dec 55
                dec 5
                dec -100
                hex 0